<title>FINLAND: RESEARCH ALERT - AROS UPS AMER TO BUY.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AROS UPS AMER TO BUY.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aros Securities said on Tuesday it had upgraded its recommendation on Finnish sporting goods group Amer-yhtyma Oy to buy from reduce.</p>
<p>Analyst Lauri Rosendahl said by telephone that Aros forecast a 0.81 markka loss per share for Amer's full-year 1997, and earnings per share (EPS) of 5.34 markka in 1998 and of 10.81 markka in 1999.</p>
<p>Aros set a 12-month price target for Amer of 135 markka, he said.</p>
<p>At 1325/1025 GMT, Amer's A shares traded at 98.80 markka, up 0.80 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
